- The cluster amendment text.
- David Toyer's 23 Sep TDR letter, which both cities cite but which isn't published.
- La Center's reply to Commerce, which isn't in the compiled city responses.
- The 2027 legislative item, which has no attachment.
- Exhibits 2 and 3 of the comp plan package: I only searched them for "cluster" and didn't read them in full.
